00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.880
Mama...

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:49.590
Alright!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.630
In that case,

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.840
I'll help you search for your mama!

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:58.520
I'll jump and you look around for your mama.

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.100
Here we go!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.480
Did you see her?

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:11.240
That was awesome. You went so high.

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:12.950
Oh? Was it fun?

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.490
Let's try it once more.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:15.490
Here we go!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.490
Again!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:20.870
Kazuya!

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:22.710
Kazuya!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.710
Where could he have gone?

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.210
He doesn't even know his home address.

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.840
Where the heck did Futaba run off to?

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.840
She can't even remember her home address.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:35.090
You should have been watching her more carefully!

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.760
This foot massager was just too good.

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:39.930
We're going so fast!

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.480
Faster!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.480
Alright.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:43.810
Let's go that way!

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:44.770
Yes, sir.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.400
And this way!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.440
Roger that.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:48.440
Let's go outside, too!

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:49.940
Sure thing!

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:55.360
You should pass him.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:56.160
Yes!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.290
Topknot!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:03.830
Jump over the river!

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:04.460
Okay.

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:15.030
Pa pa pappai pa pa pa pappai!

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:22.080
A, B, C, D, E, and F

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.500
The bigger they are the better!

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:26.590
They are all my favorites, after all!

00:17:26.590 --> 00:17:28.960
The world cup's an F cup!

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:31.840
G, H, I, J, K, and L

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.090
I'm picky on the shape, too!

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:36.260
I won't hesitate to pursue them!

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:38.470
Can you be new?

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:42.930
If I could have just one wish,

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:48.020
I would want to play hide-and-seek in a sweet jiggly forest!

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:50.820
Should I choose A-Cup? B-Cup? C, D, E-Cup?

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:52.940
No wait, G-Cup!

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:55.660
Cheers and drink 1, 3, 6, 8 10, 16 times!

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:58.030
I'm full 'cause I ate too much apple pie!

00:17:58.030 --> 00:18:00.160
Pineapple's sour, so it's a big failure!

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.830
Pi + Pi + Pi + Pi = 4Pi!

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:05.250
Senpai, I'll do my best!

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:07.630
I can't take this bittersweet and salty drink so sugar please!

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:09.750
Hey pilot! You failed to cheer, so it's something to fear!

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:15.430
Feel the massage of the 4Pis!

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:21.180
Pa pa pa pai pa pa pa pa pai!

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:28.100
A, B, C, D, E, and F

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:30.480
Check the boobs on your first encounter!

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:32.400
I'm serious about this!

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:34.950
Coffee cups are E-Cups!

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:37.660
G, H, I, J, K, and L

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.080
It's just a normal healthy hobby of mine!

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:42.080
I'm deeply engrossed in it, after all!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.450
He knew backin' you!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.450
He knew backin' you!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:47.500
shosei mo itsuka otona ni nattara

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:47.560
Someday I will be an adult as well...

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.280
Where...

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.320
...are we?

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:59.070
Hmm.

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:01.570
I can't even see the department store from here.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:05.200
You idiot.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.040
You told me to go outside, though.

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:12.580
You're trying to blame me now!

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:24.010
What does your mama look like?

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:26.640
Did you know I'm really good at drawing?

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:29.560
Her face?

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:33.940
Her eyes are really big.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.480
What about her hair?

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:37.940
It's brown and she's got it like this.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:39.940
Her nose?

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:41.950
Um...

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:45.740
It's done!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:46.990
How's that?

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:49.410
It's Mama!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:52.420
Brown

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.250
Mama!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.750
Mama!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.420
Mama!

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.380
Mama...

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:19.150
Lost Children Center

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.150
Yes, understood.

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:21.860
That was from the policebox in the next town over.

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:24.200
They found both of them!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:27.410
It seems as though they were found sleeping soundly together next to the road.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:30.540
The road?

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:31.910
Sleeping?

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.920
Mama!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:40.960
Just how much do you intend to embarrass me?!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:43.430
We just happened to doze off. That's all.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.930
I'm so sorry for taking him so far!

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.510
Mama, Topknot is really amazing!

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:51.520
She drew a picture of Mama on the ground!

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:52.770
It looked exactly like you!

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.770
And then, we fell asleep!

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.940
A picture of me?

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:59.650
It's nothing compared to the real thing.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:02.400
I'd like to thank you...

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:03.700
...for taking care of Kazuya like this.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.740
Topknot?

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:08.910
Will you play with me again?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.670
But of course, Young Master!

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.250
See you again!

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:22.760
Bye bye, Topknot!

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:26.930
It must have been nice to play with an older girl like that, huh?

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:27.890
Yup!

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.810
You know I really did want to see that picture of me.

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:32.310
You can still see it.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:33.270
It's right over here.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.190
See?

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:38.480
It's right over there.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:46.990
You are never to play with that girl again.

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:48.110
Good grief.

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:51.080
What were you doing getting lost with a nice little boy like that?

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:54.330
It was just so much fun that we ended up coming all the way here by mistake.

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:22.040
As the sun sets on the schoolyard

00:22:22.180 --> 00:22:27.310
I waved my hand, and head back home

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:32.490
Tonight, when I go to bed

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:37.790
It'd be great if I can see you again

00:22:38.070 --> 00:22:43.340
Let's go to sleep

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:47.290
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:54.380
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:22:54.750 --> 00:22:59.280
You can even fly into the sky

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:13.830
My heart aches when I hold your hand, even in my dream

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:19.290
Just like my dream-colored love

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:27.050
Wait a minute, Hitoha.

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:29.670
Are there some of those black dust-like mites in our house?

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:32.720
We've got something fat and dark lurking around that's comparably gross.

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:37.140
It's always opening the fridge at random and causing all sorts of other problems.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:40.010
Santa Claus Is My Sweetheart

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:39.350
Hmm? I had no idea.
